      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I've noticed the same issues. It's completely broken and disappointing to see this pushed live in this state. I don't know how VRchat went from map wide 2d sound issues to requiring players to stand on top of other players to hear whatever is now considered \"max volume\" but some reassessment is required here. I don't know what happen recently to get to this point but it seems super over kill. The seemly logermthmic fall off dropping the volume over 50% in a matter of 1.5 meters amazingly face palm material. It's not even reasonable. The user voice direction is also a problem. Map ONSP sounds are now 1000% louder as well. Like I said these changes needed a lot of work before they made it into a patch. I hope the quality control improves in future patches.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
